      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Toggle: Singed lays a poisonous trail that deals (20/30/40/50/60 + (42.5% Ability Power)) magic damage per second. Cloud duration: 3.25 seconds. Poison duration: 2 seconds. Approximate total damage: (95/142.5/190/237.5/285 + (201.875% Ability Power)) magic damage. If a minion would be killed by minion damage while under the effects of Poison Trail, Singed claims the kill credit instead.",
      "variant": null
    },
